  "exam_fact_quotes": [
    {
      "chapter": 1,
      "quote": "那是居民对郁澄的叫法，扣子就是郁澄的别名。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 2,
      "quote": "棱纹测距轮当时由岑望持有。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 2,
      "quote": "岑望抬头答应，众人也就知道长尺是他的别名，而不是又来了一个负责测量的人。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": false
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 3,
      "quote": "郁澄右腕受伤，必须戴夹板，不能提重物。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 4,
      "quote": "小锣是大家给杜葵起的别名，她听见就从手边提起壶。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 4,
      "quote": "赭釉水壶属于杜葵，此时也由她自己收着用。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 5,
      "quote": "她请费泊再挪开一点遮着的叶屑，众人便看见旧梯背面有两枚相邻的凹点，没人知道它们的来源。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 6,
      "quote": "阿栓是费泊的别名，他头也不抬地答道，得先看看哪里在磨。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 6,
      "quote": "费泊身边放着他保管的白角线轴，白角线轴的持有人是费泊。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 7,
      "quote": "岑望只获准旁听这次会议，没有签字权限。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 9,
      "quote": "银齿票夹原本属于陶汀，也由陶汀保管。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 11,
      "quote": "岑望把棱纹测距轮正式交给江穗，从这一刻起，棱纹测距轮由江穗保管。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 14,
      "quote": "杜葵指着眼前临时搭起的棚位，说明食堂目前只有流动棚位，没有固定厨房。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "quote": "费泊的左手天生只有四根手指。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 17,
      "quote": "第一次试音结束，郁澄把那段录音留在口袋里，没有删掉，也没有拿出来播放。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": false,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 18,
      "quote": "祁砚出生在折岭的岔灯坪。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 19,
      "quote": "她拿出画图用的炭笔，先在另纸上试了一下浓淡。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": false,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 20,
      "quote": "黎弦此时尚不能独立读懂剖面图，图上的切面和他熟悉的行走方向总会混在一起。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    }
